{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3606850","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016宝可梦全球大奖","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-05-22","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 大賞！（Congratulations !）","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3606850/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"皮卡丘现身 Google I/O，为《宝可梦消消乐》全球化表现助阵，并庆祝它夺得全球组别大奖。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ポケモン"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 大賞！（Congratulations !）","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3606850.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160524032354id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3606850.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">皮卡丘？\nPikachu？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/001-540efc6fff.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/001-540efc6fff.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"574\" height=\"764\"></a></figure>\n\n\n※这张照片来自2015年横滨皮卡丘大量发生中\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦官网的 Twitter……\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/002-8420996e51.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/002-8420996e51.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"604\" height=\"746\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n为什么皮卡丘会\n出现在 Google I/O 上？\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我还在想，\n难道皮卡丘要获奖吗？（笑）\n之类的……\n\n        皮卡丘获奖？\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n        没想到！\n    \n“宝可梦消消乐”手机版荣获 Google I/O 2016\n全球组别大奖！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/003-218236614e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/003-218236614e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"746\" height=\"425\"></a></figure>\n\n\n“Pokémon Shuffle Mobile”是北美地区的名称！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n        2016 Google Play 大奖得主\n全球拓展组\n“<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-video-games/pokemon-shuffle-mobile/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pokémon Shuffle Mobile</a>”！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n因为它同时\n面向多个语言地区推出，\n所以获得了提名\n\n<br>\n\n\n……\n\n<br>\n\n\n原来如此！\n皮卡丘\n是去给它加油的啊！！\n皮卡丘为宝可梦消消乐加油了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n果然厉害！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n“宝可梦消消乐”的开发与运营由\nGenius Sonority株式会社负责\n感谢你们带来\n这么有趣的软件！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有，\n全球组别\n大奖\n恭喜你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n以各种形式\n获得认可的宝可梦，\n\n真的让人非常开心！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（这么值得庆祝，来宣传一下！）\n\n<br>\n\n\n“宝可梦消消乐”\n\n\n有\n3DS版　iPhone版　Android版\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n详情请查看官方网站！\n点击这里！\n↓\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon.co.jp/ex/poketoru/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“宝可梦消消乐”官方网站</a></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ピカチュウ？\nPikachu?\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/001-540efc6fff.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/001-540efc6fff.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"574\" height=\"764\"></a></figure>\n\n\n※この写真は横浜ピカチュウ大量発生中2015より\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nPokémon.comのTwitter・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/002-8420996e51.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/002-8420996e51.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"604\" height=\"746\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n何でピカチュウが\nGoogle I/Oに？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nピカチュウが賞もらうの？（笑）\nとか思ってたけど・・\n\n        Pikachu award?\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        なんと！\n    \n「ポケとる」スマホ版がGoogle I/O 2016\nグローバル部門で大賞を受賞！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/003-218236614e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3606850/003-218236614e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"746\" height=\"425\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\"Pokémon Shuffle Mobile\" が北米での名前！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        2016 Google Play Award Winners \nGo Global\n\"<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-video-games/pokemon-shuffle-mobile/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pokémon Shuffle Mobile</a>\"!!\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n多言語を同時に\n展開しているということで\nノミネートされていたんです\n\n<br>\n\n\n・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\nそうか！\nピカチュウ\n応援にいってたのか！！\nPikachu cheered for Pokémon Shuffle Mobile!\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさすが！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n「ポケとる」の開発・運営は\nジニアス・ソノリティ（株）さん\n楽しいソフトを\nありがとうございます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nグローバル部門\n大賞\nおめでとうございます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいろいろな形で\nポケモンが評価されるのは\n\nとても嬉しいです！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（めでたいので宣伝！）\n\n<br>\n\n\n「ポケとる」には\n\n3DS版  iPhone版  android版\n\nがあります！\n\n<br>\n\n\n詳しくは公式サイトで！\nここをクリック！\n↓\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon.co.jp/ex/poketoru/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">「ポケとる」公式サイト</a></div>"}}